TITLE 1D transport: exchange, 10 cells, 10 shifts; SC in cell 1 each shift

SOLUTION 0 Inflow
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset true
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings shift sc_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SHIFT, SC
END
